    {
      "id": "youtube",
      "title": "YouTube",
      "displayName": "PumpDuel",
      "bio": "Build a habit. Together.\n\nPumpDuel turns everyday workouts into something you can share. Create or join a private group, show up for daily workouts, and keep each other going. Challenge a friend when it suits you, or meet them in a live fitness duel.\n\nCount push-ups, pull-ups and squats with your iPhone camera. Track your repetitions and recent activity as you build your routine.\n\nGroups and some competition features require PumpDuel Pro.\n\nExplore PumpDuel: https://pumpduel.com\nSupport: https://pumpduel.com/support"
    },
